# wooden door - 1 wide (X), 2 tall (Y), thin (renders microcube-thin via DoorManager)
# Hinge edge at local X=0, Z=0. Door extends along +X. Paneled: Log frame, Wood panels, Gold knob.
# interaction_point: handle_0 door_handle 0.5 0.833 1.0 0.0 * 2.00 "Open / Close" 90.0
# Format: S px py pz sx sy sz Material  |  M px py pz sx sy sz mx my mz Material
# part: panel hinge=left_bottom axis=y

S 0 0 0 0 0 0 Log
S 0 0 0 0 1 0 Log
S 0 0 0 0 2 0 Log
S 0 1 0 0 0 0 Log
S 0 1 0 0 1 0 Log
S 0 1 0 0 2 0 Log
S 0 0 0 1 0 0 Log
S 0 0 0 1 1 0 Wood
S 0 0 0 1 2 0 Wood
S 0 1 0 1 0 0 Log
S 0 1 0 1 1 0 Wood
S 0 1 0 1 2 0 Log
S 0 0 0 2 0 0 Log
S 0 0 0 2 1 0 Log
S 0 0 0 2 2 0 Log
S 0 1 0 2 0 0 Log
S 0 1 0 2 1 0 Log
S 0 1 0 2 2 0 Log
M 0 0 0 1 2 0 1 0 2 Gold
M 0 0 0 1 2 0 1 1 2 Gold
